'''Pachinko''' is a minigame accessed through the Arcade button in the [[Gem Shop]]. Reach [[Desert]] to unlock it.

==Mechanic==
[[File:Arcade_probability.png|thumb|Graphical view of rewards probability]]

The player can launch Pachinko balls [[File:Arcade_pachinko_ball.png|20px]] and watch them bounce and fall into various portals containing rewards. The maximum amount of balls a player can have 49, so it is advised the player collects them every day. The player can complete tasks and level [[Hatchery|Pet Passives]] to increase the rate at which balls are collected. The player can also buy 100 balls for 275 [[Gem Shop|Gems]].

