==Poker Cards==
Every 22h you can collect poker cards. Launch balls until one of them falls into a portal marked with [[File:poker_reverse.png|15px]]. When it does, you receive one of the 52 poker cards at random. Collect 5 cards to receive Gems, the amount of which depends on the power of your hand.

